    prompt: 'Operations is concerned about provider no-shows and wants to identify the worst offender. Determine which provider has the highest no-show rate by calculating the percentage of appointments that were not completed. Return the provider\'s name, no-show count, total appointments, and no-show rate rounded to one decimal place. ',
