      { text: 'Consider how to identify users who have never logged in. Look for a condition that indicates the user\'s last activity is missing.', starterCode: 'SELECT u.email, a.company_name\nFROM users u\nJOIN accounts a ON u.account_id = a.account_id\n-- add filter condition to check for inactive users' }
