    datamartId: 'health',
    prompt: 'The pharmacy team at Express Scripts generates a report to calculate total medication coverage days per patient to identify gaps and schedule outreach calls. The report shows 330 days for patient 2, but the actual coverage is 450 days. Identify the bug in the calculation formula. ',
