    prompt: 'Compliance needs to identify the total disputed amount per account to assess financial risks. The query should return account_id, sum of disputed amounts, and the count of disputes per account. Ensure the results are ordered by total disputed amount in descending order. ',
    brokenQuery: 'SELECT a.account_id, a.user_id, a.account_type, SUM(d.amount) AS total_disputed\nFROM disputes d\nJOIN accounts a ON d.dispute_id = a.account_id\nGROUP BY a.account_id, a.user_id, a.account_type\nORDER BY a.account_id',
